Dialogue: 30,0:00:10.86,0:00:13.36,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:15.17,0:00:16.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:18.11,0:00:19.62,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:19.87,0:00:23.03,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Why is Dr. Nayuta here?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:23.03,0:00:25.88,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Let's leave this to Kizuna-kun.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:26.97,0:00:28.25,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Dr. Nayuta...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:31.67,0:00:34.51,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Seven years and twenty-one days, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:34.51,0:00:37.68,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,You've grown up while I wasn't around.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:38.80,0:00:41.27,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What happened, Mother?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:41.27,0:00:45.14,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, on a Batlantis battleship?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:45.63,0:00:48.03,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,It's part of my field work.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:48.03,0:00:53.65,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I needed to go to the Batlantis Empire for my research.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Research?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:56.02,0:00:59.70,Dialogue Flashback,N,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,450)}I don't need you anymore.  {no edit ep1}
Dialogue: 30,0:01:00.09,0:01:03.54,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,There's so much I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:03.54,0:01:06.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But first, come back to Ataraxia.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:06.02,0:01:07.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,We can talk there.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:08.17,0:01:09.82,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:09.82,0:01:12.47,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,My research isn't finished yet.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:14.84,0:01:17.68,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,What the hell do you mean, "research"?!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.47,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,That voice, Reiri, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:19.47,0:01:22.47,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Why are you in bed with the enemy? What are you plotting?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:23.05,0:01:27.98,Dialogue Italics,N,0,0,0,,Reiri, you don't understand why I'm doing this?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:27.98,0:01:30.07,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,There's nothing to understand!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:30.07,0:01:32.39,Dialogue Italics,N,0,0,0,,You really are stupid.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.87,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Oh, no need to worry about it, though.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:35.87,0:01:38.35,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,They say the stupider your child, the more lovable they are.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:38.35,0:01:41.49,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,And most people are stupid.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:42.58,0:01:43.58,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:43.58,0:01:45.75,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Bring her back!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:46.93,0:01:48.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:52.13,0:01:53.76,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,A hologram?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:54.13,0:01:55.25,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 30,0:01:55.25,0:01:57.01,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,but that's all for today.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:57.01,0:02:00.24,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I just came to deliver a message to you.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:01.26,0:02:04.68,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,If you want to see me, come to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:04.68,0:02:07.27,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll find something interesting.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:07.57,0:02:08.77,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,To Tokyo?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:09.18,0:02:10.20,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:13.23,0:02:14.45,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Bye, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:14.45,0:02:16.28,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I'll see you in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:17.38,0:02:20.16,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I want you to do something about everybody's cores!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:20.83,0:02:22.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,How can the cores be removed?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:22.49,0:02:24.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,How can I save them all?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:24.49,0:02:25.79,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Please, tell me!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:26.19,0:02:27.19,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:28.51,0:02:31.73,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Um, we're done.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:31.73,0:02:32.98,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,So, please leave.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:32.98,0:02:34.80,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Well, {\i1}I'm{\i0} not done!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:34.80,0:02:36.30,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Give me back my mother!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:38.26,0:02:41.14,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kicking us out all of a sudden? How rude!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.55,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:42.55,0:02:43.64,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:45.57,0:02:46.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:45.80,0:02:46.81,Dialogue Overlap,K,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:50.27,0:02:51.13,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:51.13,0:02:55.07,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I am the great Ragres-sama, \Nand this is my Magitech armor, Demon!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:55.51,0:02:57.06,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's enormous!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:57.06,0:02:59.94,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Is that really a Heart Hybrid Gear?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.58,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Now, come get some!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.58,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Take that! And that!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:09.08,0:03:11.08,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:20.77,0:03:22.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Mother!
