Dialogue: 30,0:04:54.69,0:04:55.77,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:59.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(443,473)\bord2.25\blur1.8\c&HFCFCFD&\fsp3\pos(548.5,883.715)}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:59.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(443,474)\bord2.25\blur1.8\c&HFCFCFD&\pos(519,1049.715)}Eve of the Decisive Battle -Install-
Dialogue: 30,0:04:56.15,0:05:00.86,Dialogue,Gi,900,2,0,,{\q2}Why do we, the proud royal guards,\N have to flee from the enemy?!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:00.86,0:05:04.37,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Did you show pity on them because they're fellow Lemurians?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:04.37,0:05:06.74,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That was our chance to catch Zeros!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:06.74,0:05:09.50,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I'm afraid our only goal there
Dialogue: 30,0:05:09.50,0:05:12.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was to speak with them.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.54,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Capturing Zeros wasn't a part of the plan.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:16.13,0:05:20.05,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Zelshione-sama w-was aware of this...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:21.05,0:05:22.76,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,Please wait a moment.  {no edit ep9}
Dialogue: 30,0:05:23.22,0:05:26.68,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)}She told us to follow Nayuta-sama's orders.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.81,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,But Nayuta-sama...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:29.81,0:05:33.85,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Now that they know we'll be waiting for them, \Nwill they really come to Tokyo?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:34.31,0:05:36.61,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,They'll come, Varde.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:37.44,0:05:42.24,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Because I set things up so they would.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:42.86,0:05:43.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:43.74,0:05:46.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The plan to retake Tokyo was all a setup by Mother?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:47.03,0:05:48.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Nee-chan?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:49.33,0:05:50.20,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.75,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it now.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:53.83,0:05:57.09,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Kizuna, we found out about your Eros unit's unique ability,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:57.09,0:06:00.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,restoring Hybrid Counts with Heart Hybrids,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:00.34,0:06:04.39,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,via data sent from an anonymous source.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:04.89,0:06:07.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Someone sent it to us...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:07.55,0:06:08.39,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You don't mean...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:08.89,0:06:12.14,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,The impetus for the operation to retake Tokyo
Dialogue: 30,0:06:12.14,0:06:15.98,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,was the data we acquired that\N taught us how to seal Entrances.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:15.98,0:06:20.28,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,That data was also submitted by an unknown party on Guam.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:20.73,0:06:24.28,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,And you're saying that was Dr. Nayuta?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:24.82,0:06:27.70,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Only a genius scientist like Hida Nayuta
Dialogue: 30,0:06:27.70,0:06:30.04,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,would be capable of putting together such perfect data.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:31.79,0:06:35.33,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Then what do we do now, Nee-chan?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:35.33,0:06:36.71,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We have to go.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:36.71,0:06:38.34,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,No matter what's waiting for us.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:38.34,0:06:41.05,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Even if it's a trap set by a witch.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:41.05,0:06:42.88,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:46.47,0:06:47.39,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:48.10,0:06:49.68,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you anything.   {Ed alt: Don't talk to me like that.}
Dialogue: 30,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'll obey my orders if I have to, and that is all.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:52.52,0:06:54.35,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Wait, Aine-san!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:54.35,0:06:57.48,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh dear. It's like she's back to the old Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.48,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Wait, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:59.06,0:07:02.07,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,There's something else I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:16.83,0:07:17.71,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:17.92,0:07:20.21,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Pick a new Amaterasu member?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:21.09,0:07:26.22,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,We need talented people to take back Tokyo.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:26.55,0:07:31.97,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But that means installing a Heart Hybrid Gear core in them, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:31.97,0:07:33.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.02,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'm aware.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:35.02,0:07:37.44,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'm no better than that woman.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:37.44,0:07:40.44,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,If we want this war to end someday,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:40.44,0:07:43.23,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,we can't lose this fight.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:43.98,0:07:45.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.24,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is the list of candidates.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:49.24,0:07:50.99,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Th-This is...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:51.78,0:07:54.12,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Okay, see you tomorrow, Sylvia-chan!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:54.12,0:07:55.83,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:55.83,0:07:57.50,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:58.21,0:08:01.79,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Okay, now what should Sylvia cook today?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:02.71,0:08:03.59,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:06.59,0:08:07.51,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:09.76,0:08:13.51,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Huh? You want Sylvia to be a Heart Hybrid Gear pilot?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:15.02,0:08:18.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You've got the grades and aptitude for it.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:18.39,0:08:22.52,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Then Sylvia can be a part of Amaterasu, too, can't she?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:23.02,0:08:26.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No, you should think about it more before you decide.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:31.28,0:08:35.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is an important decision for you.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:35.20,0:08:38.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nobody will judge you if you refuse.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:39.87,0:08:41.17,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I won't force you.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.80,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,If you don't want to, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.84,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You don't have to fight.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:47.51,0:08:50.18,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Why are you saying that?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:50.43,0:08:53.43,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm saying you don't have to force yourself to fight.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:53.43,0:08:56.77,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You don't think Sylvia is good enough, Captain?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:58.68,0:09:01.14,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,It was always Sylvia's dream...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:01.14,0:09:05.69,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,But you don't want Sylvia to be in Amaterasu, do you?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:05.90,0:09:07.78,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,N-No, Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:07.78,0:09:08.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:08.61,0:09:09.95,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:10.82,0:09:12.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:19.87,0:09:20.96,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.21,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,Is Sylvia that useless, Captain?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.68,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,But everybody else is fighting...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.98,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia wants to go back to London.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:46.32,0:09:47.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.15,0:09:49.61,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Let go, please!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:49.61,0:09:50.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:57.74,0:10:00.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I don't want you to die.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:01.91,0:10:03.00,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Not just you.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:04.96,0:10:06.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone to die.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:06.96,0:10:09.09,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I couldn't give that order.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:09.67,0:10:11.67,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm a failure as a captain, aren't I?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:14.76,0:10:19.14,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia has always wanted to be a part of Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:19.68,0:10:21.89,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,So that she could find her parents,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who went missing in London.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:23.98,0:10:27.27,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,But now she has another goal!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.99,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia is begging you!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.49,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Let her fight with you.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:33.49,0:10:36.16,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Let her fight for you!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:37.49,0:10:40.29,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Please let her be a part of Amaterasu!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:41.66,0:10:43.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:51.92,0:10:54.09,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,This room is so cute!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:54.09,0:10:57.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's supposedly a lab...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.52,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Listen, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:05.52,0:11:07.10,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:07.10,0:11:10.19,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm about to install this core in you.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:10.57,0:11:12.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The way this core works, uh...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I have to be the one to do it.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:15.53,0:11:17.61,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,If it's you, Sylvia doesn't mind,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:17.61,0:11:20.45,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,no, Sylvia {\i1}wants{\i0} you to do it, Captain!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:20.45,0:11:24.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Oh, then... um...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:37.76,0:11:38.93,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.64,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Is Sylvia's body ugly?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:43.14,0:11:44.47,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:44.98,0:11:46.73,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia is so glad.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:55.86,0:11:58.11,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Good work, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:01.87,0:12:03.12,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:03.12,0:12:04.24,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:07.58,0:12:12.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I guess she still needs tuning before she can sortie.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:12.63,0:12:14.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone die.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.01,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'll save them all.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:16.21,0:12:17.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,And for that...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:19.38,0:12:20.76,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:20.76,0:12:23.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'll bring you back for sure!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:23.76,0:12:25.97,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,The mission starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:25.97,0:12:27.10,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:27.48,0:12:30.60,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hi everyone, the Engineering Division comes bearing gifts!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:36.19,0:12:38.49,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:38.90,0:12:42.62,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Anti-Magitech particle rifles, and the new railguns, too!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.99,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Anti-material rifles!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:45.62,0:12:47.25,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,My Luger-chan, too!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:47.25,0:12:48.58,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Luger-chan?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:48.58,0:12:50.12,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That's her name!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:50.12,0:12:51.42,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Isn't she cute?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:52.83,0:12:56.80,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Well, this is enough to make sure we succeed tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:56.80,0:12:59.05,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We can't let Amaterasu outshine us!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:59.05,0:13:01.55,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Show them what the Masters can do!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:01.55,0:13:02.76,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:03.22,0:13:06.26,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,By the way, where is Amaterasu?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:11.14,0:13:12.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I figured you'd be here.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:13.81,0:13:16.61,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I like looking at the sea.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:17.57,0:13:19.19,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And being alone while doing so.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:21.53,0:13:23.95,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It's fine. You don't have to say anything.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:23.95,0:13:26.45,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It would make me happy if you just left, though.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:36.04,0:13:37.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:37.92,0:13:40.05,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Are you worried about me?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:40.05,0:13:42.09,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,If you are, I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:43.05,0:13:47.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But because of, uh, how things went last time,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,you haven't done your Heart Hybrid yet.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:51.14,0:13:54.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I just said I'm fine.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:55.56,0:14:00.24,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Are you so stupid that you can't \Nunderstand something that simple?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:02.49,0:14:03.41,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:03.41,0:14:04.99,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That wasn't like me.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:06.16,0:14:08.29,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Crying to an Eros Overlord like you
Dialogue: 30,0:14:08.29,0:14:11.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just because I had a weird dream.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:11.75,0:14:13.42,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It was the biggest mistake of my life!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:13.42,0:14:15.83,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And the worst moment of my life, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:17.38,0:14:19.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I was just worried about you.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.26,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm me.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:21.26,0:14:23.76,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No one but Chidorigafuchi Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:26.39,0:14:27.43,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:28.22,0:14:30.47,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:30.47,0:14:33.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,As the best pilot in the universe, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine...
