Dialogue: 30,0:15:02.80,0:15:05.09,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,When I heard we were going back to Tokyo,
Dialogue: 30,0:15:05.09,0:15:06.93,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,to be honest, I was scared.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:07.22,0:15:10.93,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I was scared that my past might crush me again.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:11.43,0:15:15.14,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But now I can look forward to the future.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:17.02,0:15:18.94,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to Kizuna-kun.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:20.61,0:15:21.78,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:21.78,0:15:23.19,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.82,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I was able to change because of Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:27.24,0:15:30.33,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I realized that it's okay to rely more on others.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:30.87,0:15:32.62,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,But it's a little frustrating...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:32.62,0:15:36.12,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,that a single boy like him was enough to change me.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.83,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's not just that something's changed.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.59,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It feels like something new has begun.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.88,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,"Something new has begun," huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:49.47,0:15:53.22,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Is something new beginning for her, too?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:57.81,0:16:00.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is where it all began, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:07.90,0:16:09.78,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:14.95,0:16:16.75,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:17.79,0:16:18.83,Dialogue Flashback,A,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:20.71,0:16:22.50,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,You don't know why yourself?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:23.25,0:16:26.38,Dialogue Flashback,A,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about myself...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:27.47,0:16:28.38,Dialogue Flashback,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:29.09,0:16:31.64,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,Then I'll think about it together with you. {Then I'll think with you.}
Dialogue: 30,0:16:33.56,0:16:36.93,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,If you don't know, then we'll think \Nabout it and figure it out together.{If you don't know, then I'll think about it with you to figure it out.} {If you don't know, then I'll think with you and figure it out.}
Dialogue: 30,0:16:36.93,0:16:37.64,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:42.90,0:16:43.98,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:44.61,0:16:48.28,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No matter how stubborn and strong-willed she can be,
Dialogue: 30,0:16:49.82,0:16:51.07,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,she's a crybaby,
Dialogue: 30,0:16:51.61,0:16:53.37,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,and a normal girl like any other.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Back then...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:57.87,0:17:00.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,If I'd grabbed her hand,
Dialogue: 30,0:17:00.83,0:17:02.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,what would've happened?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:45.71,0:17:47.75,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So, did you sleep well last night?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:47.75,0:17:49.71,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Yup. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.01,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I slept like a baby.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:54.68,0:17:56.60,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Hi, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:56.60,0:17:57.81,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Kizuna-kun.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:59.39,0:18:03.06,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine, I'll make sure you're—
Dialogue: 30,0:18:06.40,0:18:07.27,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:13.24,0:18:16.07,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Magitech weapons, codename Vikings, have landed on Ataraxia!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.29,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,They attacked us first?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:22.08,0:18:23.29,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,They're here, too!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:24.67,0:18:26.29,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:38.14,0:18:39.93,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Leave this to us!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:40.39,0:18:42.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You guys hurry and get to Tokyo!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:42.43,0:18:43.94,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Scarlet!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:43.94,0:18:44.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:48.23,0:18:49.19,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:52.74,0:18:53.53,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Eros!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:54.20,0:18:55.32,Dialogue Alternate,Y,1650,0,0,,{\3c&H35ACDE&}Kuros!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:55.32,0:18:56.57,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,1650,0,,{\3c&H584DDB&}Neros!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:56.57,0:18:57.32,Dialogue Alternate,A,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAA690F&}Zeros!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:12.34,0:19:14.09,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Amaterasu has taken off!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:23.47,0:19:26.31,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wow! Quite the welcome party!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:26.31,0:19:28.23,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,This much was to be expected!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:28.61,0:19:29.77,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Everyone split up
Dialogue: 30,0:19:29.77,0:19:31.82,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,and head to your designated points!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:31.82,0:19:32.48,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:36.36,0:19:37.45,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:46.96,0:19:47.83,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:06.02,0:20:08.52,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Fly low and quiet...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:09.90,0:20:11.52,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Where should I land?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:14.98,0:20:15.90,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:33.00,0:20:33.75,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:35.92,0:20:37.80,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Point A setup complete.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:41.43,0:20:42.93,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Here it comes, here it comes!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:42.93,0:20:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's finally here!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:44.43,0:20:47.56,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The signal from Point A is finally here!  {alt Len: Transmission established with Point A.}
Dialogue: 30,0:20:47.56,0:20:48.43,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:49.14,0:20:52.40,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We're getting signals from points B, C, and D, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:52.40,0:20:53.86,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Analyzing data.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:55.53,0:20:58.07,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Entrance coordinates confirmed.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:58.61,0:21:00.57,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Launch the second squad!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:04.03,0:21:08.33,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Set the sealing system up immediately and seal the Entrances!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:09.71,0:21:10.46,Dialogue,Masters,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:13.29,0:21:14.96,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, everyone!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:25.97,0:21:28.39,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Now I just have to wreak some havoc!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:28.39,0:21:30.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,If you really want a decoy operation,
Dialogue: 30,0:21:30.10,0:21:31.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,then I'll give you one!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:46.28,0:21:47.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:50.91,0:21:52.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
